{{define "title"}}Google · Integrations{{end}}
{{define "heading"}}Settings · Integrations · Google{{end}}
{{define "content"}}{{$d := .Data}}{{$csrf := .CSRF}}
{{template "settings_tabs" (dict "Tab" "integrations" "Auth" .Auth "Settings" .Settings)}}
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
  <section class="rounded-lg border bg-card p-4 text-sm">
    <h2 class="font-medium">1. Create the Google client</h2>
    <ol class="mt-2 flex list-decimal flex-col gap-1.5 ps-5 text-muted-foreground">
      <li>Open <a class="underline" href="https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Google Cloud credentials</a> and create a project (or pick one).</li>
      <li>Configure the <a class="underline" href="https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials/consent" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">OAuth consent screen</a> as External, then add your own address as a test user.</li>
      <li>Enable the <a class="underline" href="https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/calendar-json.googleapis.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Google Calendar API</a>.</li>
      <li>Create credentials of type <strong>Web application</strong> and add this authorised redirect URI: <code class="break-all font-mono text-xs">{{$d.redirect}}</code></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">If Google rejects that URI, register the same path on a host you control, or use the paste-back box below with any registered URI.</p>
  </section>

  <form method="post" action="/settings/integrations/google" class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-lg border bg-card p-4 text-sm" autocomplete="off">
    <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{$csrf}}">
    <h2 class="font-medium">2. Client ID and secret</h2>
    <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div role="group" class="field">
        <label for="google-client-id">Client ID</label>
        <input id="google-client-id" name="client_id" type="text" value="{{$d.client_id}}" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
      </div>
      <div role="group" class="field">
        <label for="google-client-secret">Client secret</label>
        <input id="google-client-secret" name="client_secret" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="{{if $d.client_secret_set}}set; type to replace{{end}}">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div><button type="submit" class="btn" data-size="sm">{{icon "check"}}Save</button></div>
  </form>

  <form method="post" action="/settings/integrations/google/start" class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-lg border bg-card p-4 text-sm">
    <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{$csrf}}">
    <h2 class="font-medium">3. Consent</h2>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground">One consent per capability. The refresh token is stored as a secret and can be pinned with its <code>*_file</code> variable.</p>
    <div role="group" class="field">
      <label for="google-capability">Capability</label>
      <select id="google-capability" name="capability">
        {{range $d.capabilities}}<option value="{{.name}}"{{if eq .name $d.selected}} selected{{end}}>{{.label}}</option>{{end}}
      </select>
    </div>
    <div><button type="submit" class="btn" data-size="sm">{{icon "external-link"}}Connect Google</button></div>
    <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Google shows the consent screen in the browser. If the redirect cannot reach atrium, copy the full URL from the address bar and paste it below.</p>
  </form>

  <form method="post" action="/settings/integrations/google/paste" class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-lg border bg-card p-4 text-sm">
    <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{$csrf}}">
    <h2 class="font-medium">Paste-back fallback</h2>
    <div role="group" class="field">
      <label for="google-paste">Redirect URL</label>
      <textarea id="google-paste" name="paste" rows="2" spellcheck="false" placeholder="https://…/callback?state=…&amp;code=…">{{$d.paste}}</textarea>
    </div>
    <div><button type="submit" class="btn" data-size="sm">{{icon "check"}}Finish consent</button></div>
  </form>

  <section class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-lg border bg-card p-4 text-sm">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
      <h2 class="font-medium">Health</h2>
      <span class="badge" data-variant="{{if eq $d.health "ok"}}secondary{{else if eq $d.health "untested"}}outline{{else}}destructive{{end}}">{{replace "_" " " (or $d.health "untested")}}</span>
      {{with $d.reason}}<span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">{{.}}</span>{{end}}
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">If the OAuth consent screen is in <strong>Testing</strong>, Google expires refresh tokens after 7 days. Publish the app to Production for long-lived tokens.</p>
    <form method="post" action="/settings/integrations/google/test">
      <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{$csrf}}">
      <button type="submit" class="btn" data-size="sm">{{icon "refresh-cw"}}Test refresh token</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  {{with $d.error}}<p class="text-sm text-destructive" role="alert" tabindex="-1" autofocus>{{.}}</p>{{end}}
</div>
{{end}}
